# SPDX-License-Identifier: MPL-2.0
# Fittings in an IFC file (bim_ifc_native.dl): the model keeps no fitting,
# it derives one where segments meet. Two pipes on an elbow are drawn on to
# the corner, three on a tee with a reducer on one leg to the tee's middle,
# and those fittings are left out of the import and listed as taken over.
# A reducer between pipes whose axes lie 20 mm apart is not taken over,
# and its pipes stay as the file has them. A pipe with three take-offs on
# its side (two opposite each other, one further on) is cut in two at each
# foot and the branches drawn on to its axis.
# A duct given as a faceted B-rep, shorter (150 mm) than it is wide (450 mm),
# runs the way its two ports say.
import ifc/bim_ifc_native.dl
import mep/common/bim_network.dl
import ui/editor/bim_editor.dl

